{"3375990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PC Cafe Simulator","steam_appid":3375990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, run, and grow your very own PC cafe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Cafe Simulator is a management simulation game set in a Korean PC cafe—an internet cafe built for PC gaming. Become the owner of a PC cafe and grow it from a small shop into a popular place filled with customers. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own PC Cafe<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase the furniture and equipment you need to run your PC cafe and decorate it your way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6a0a6376559586b844e21a242b8fd1c3.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6a0a6376559586b844e21a242b8fd1c3.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6a0a6376559586b844e21a242b8fd1c3.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customization features to create an interior with the atmosphere you want.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook and Serve a Variety of Food<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/9cfc7d3cb42ddf36a4e39fc38c5c1423.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/9cfc7d3cb42ddf36a4e39fc38c5c1423.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/9cfc7d3cb42ddf36a4e39fc38c5c1423.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Korean PC cafe is complete without food! Cook the food your customers order and serve it to them yourself. Keep your customers satisfied with delicious meals and increase your sales.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order Supplies and Manage Your Inventory<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/53a338366a08af2c6e5759db13047605.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/53a338366a08af2c6e5759db13047605.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/53a338366a08af2c6e5759db13047605.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order the supplies you need for your PC cafe and receive deliveries.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the inventory needed to keep your store running. Stock up on the food your customers want and run your store efficiently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Customers and Staff<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your PC cafe, sit down, play games, order food, and leave reviews based on their experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no customers, head outside and attract passersby to bring more people into your PC cafe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rain or Shine<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6ff92990eae40292923eb675b5822dc5.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6ff92990eae40292923eb675b5822dc5.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6ff92990eae40292923eb675b5822dc5.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun rises and sets as time passes, and the weather changes from day to day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deal With Troublemakers Yourself<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/da9cc4e6740df8f611baa782dc5ede51.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/da9cc4e6740df8f611baa782dc5ede51.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/da9cc4e6740df8f611baa782dc5ede51.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may run away without paying or cause a scene. Deal with them yourself using a broom!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Alone or With Friends<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/e2d755f7e135572d26332eeaf7bd2a2b.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/e2d755f7e135572d26332eeaf7bd2a2b.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/e2d755f7e135572d26332eeaf7bd2a2b.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your PC cafe at your own pace in single-player, or split up roles with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players and manage the store more efficiently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/d5f38039a9854d1574782452cf1327fd.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/d5f38039a9854d1574782452cf1327fd.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/d5f38039a9854d1574782452cf1327fd.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need a break, relax by listening to music or watching videos. You can enjoy them while working in your store too!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6180c54dd0f8a68803203252e5c96b08.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6180c54dd0f8a68803203252e5c96b08.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6180c54dd0f8a68803203252e5c96b08.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After closing time, buy fireworks and enjoy a fireworks show with your friends!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/dd538def533bdf8e7aa77a5bfc3f48ee.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/dd538def533bdf8e7aa77a5bfc3f48ee.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/dd538def533bdf8e7aa77a5bfc3f48ee.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create fun moments using a variety of emotes!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/63fe101e18e2af730673d0f727865076.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/63fe101e18e2af730673d0f727865076.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/63fe101e18e2af730673d0f727865076.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one of your lazy friends is not doing their job, teach them a lesson with your broom!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, run, and grow your very own PC cafe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Cafe Simulator is a management simulation game set in a Korean PC cafe—an internet cafe built for PC gaming. Become the owner of a PC cafe and grow it from a small shop into a popular place filled with customers. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own PC Cafe<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"vid