 is complete without food! Cook the food your customers order and serve it to them yourself. Keep your customers satisfied with delicious meals and increase your sales.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order Supplies and Manage Your Inventory<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/53a338366a08af2c6e5759db13047605.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/53a338366a08af2c6e5759db13047605.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/53a338366a08af2c6e5759db13047605.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order the supplies you need for your PC cafe and receive deliveries.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the inventory needed to keep your store running. Stock up on the food your customers want and run your store efficiently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Customers and Staff<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your PC cafe, sit down, play games, order food, and leave reviews based on their experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no customers, head outside and attract passersby to bring more people into your PC cafe.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rain or Shine<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6ff92990eae40292923eb675b5822dc5.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6ff92990eae40292923eb675b5822dc5.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6ff92990eae40292923eb675b5822dc5.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun rises and sets as time passes, and the weather changes from day to day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deal With Troublemakers Yourself<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/da9cc4e6740df8f611baa782dc5ede51.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/da9cc4e6740df8f611baa782dc5ede51.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/da9cc4e6740df8f611baa782dc5ede51.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may run away without paying or cause a scene. Deal with them yourself using a broom!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Alone or With Friends<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/e2d755f7e135572d26332eeaf7bd2a2b.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/e2d755f7e135572d26332eeaf7bd2a2b.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/e2d755f7e135572d26332eeaf7bd2a2b.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your PC cafe at your own pace in single-player, or split up roles with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players and manage the store more efficiently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/d5f38039a9854d1574782452cf1327fd.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/d5f38039a9854d1574782452cf1327fd.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/d5f38039a9854d1574782452cf1327fd.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need a break, relax by listening to music or watching videos. You can enjoy them while working in your store too!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6180c54dd0f8a68803203252e5c96b08.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6180c54dd0f8a68803203252e5c96b08.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/6180c54dd0f8a68803203252e5c96b08.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After closing time, buy fireworks and enjoy a fireworks show with your friends!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/dd538def533bdf8e7aa77a5bfc3f48ee.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/dd538def533bdf8e7aa77a5bfc3f48ee.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/dd538def533bdf8e7aa77a5bfc3f48ee.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create fun moments using a variety of emotes!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/63fe101e18e2af730673d0f727865076.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/63fe101e18e2af730673d0f727865076.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/extras\/63fe101e18e2af730673d0f727865076.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one of your lazy friends is not doing their job, teach them a lesson with your broom!<\/p>","short_description":"Run your own Korean PC cafe! From customer service to cooking and store management — experience life as a PC cafe owner. Start small, hire staff, expand your store, and deal with troublesome customers yourself! Play solo or co-op with up to 8 players.","supported_languages":"English, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Italian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/24781a0d04f823aed89b705bde96b72595dd04c2\/header.jpg?t=1793152808","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/cbe849bdadeadd536a3c7ab8ef07c68bf4b7f8ee\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793152808","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3375990\/cbe849bdadeadd536a3c7ab8ef07c68bf4b7f8ee\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793152808","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-10700 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 \/ AMD RX 6700 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 10 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<st